nt monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc32𐠳\udc1f\udc2f\ud802\ud802𐠦 \ud802\ud802𐠊\udc31\udc01\ud802\ud802𐠕\udc14\udc18\udc25\ud802𐠫\ud802𐠖𐠦\udc15\ud802𐠸𐠩\udc16𐠙\udc08𐠥 𐠎</div>"},{"id":"marker125","name":"Bralgag Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠷𐠧𐠞\udc1a𐠣\ud802\ud802𐠭\udc2f\udc1f\udc24\ud802𐠎\udc03 \ud802𐠗𐠬\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠜\udc19\udc19𐠱\udc0f\udc2e𐠖\ud802\ud802𐠩 \udc17\udc16\udc2c\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠩\udc16\ud802 \ud802𐠍\udc10𐠵 \ud802\ud802𐠈</div>"},{"id":"marker126","name":"Castkeep Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡟᡐᡒᡱᡗᠼᢋᡔᡝᡑᢛᡮᠧᡑᢓᠭᢠᠽᡔᡑᠵᢛᠡᠵᠠ᠑ᠻᢛᢑᡏᢂᢟᢑᠰᠾᢑᡓᢏᡞᠳᡜᡙᡞᠨᢡᡲᠻᠽᠩᠮᡁᠧᡯᡑᠽᢂ᠀ᠨᠻᡲᢐᢂ᠒ᠼᡐᠪᠳᡖᡙᡀᢠᠭᢦᡕᠮᡍᢢᡯᠭᢁᢀ</div>"},{"id":"marker127","name":"Larionnor Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802\ud802𐠒\ud802 𐠄\udc1d𐠄\udc0d\udc03𐠵 \udc33\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠏\udc03𐠊\ud802\ud802𐠤\udc2c\udc0a\udc2e𐠣\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802 \udc0b𐠒\udc08\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker128","name":"Sheora Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠞\udc1f\ud802 \udc2a\ud802𐠍\udc22𐠍\udc0e \udc1f𐠋\ud802𐠓\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠴𐠨\udc1f\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠞\udc03𐠈\ud802 \ud802\ud802 𐠌\ud802𐠏</div>"},{"id":"marker129","name":"Pereley Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802 𐠋𐠐\udc13\udc37\udc1d𐠔 𐠛\udc34 \udc38\ud802𐠌\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠼\udc1f\udc04𐠊\udc18\udc0d\udc01\udc1c \udc22 \udc2c𐠑\udc0a\ud802𐠃\udc14\ud802𐠒\udc27\udc2f \ud802𐠰\udc1d\udc27\udc0e\ud802 \udc05\udc2f\udc0e\udc11\udc02\udc3c𐠱\udc1e\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠡\udc34𐠩\udc35𐠃\udc02\udc3c\udc08\ud802𐠙\udc1a\ud802𐠛\udc01𐠰\udc1c\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker130","name":"Salborough Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc3f𐠖\udc3f\udc19\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠿\udc13\udc0a𐠬\ud802\ud802𐠭\udc3c𐠵𐠙 \udc0f\ud802\ud802𐠄𐠃\udc0b𐠒\udc05\udc12\udc11𐠢</div>"},{"id":"marker131","name":"Somerley Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠼᢠᡒᢀᡎᡆᠿᡙᡜᢥᠮᡙᡡᠪᡯᡕᢒᡠᢁᡏᢂᢦᡱᡮᠽᡀᢥ᠐ᠵᢋᠾᠩᠩᡯᡯᡀᡴᢁᡞᡮᠽ᠒ᠻᡡᡟᡡᢞᢂᠩᠨᡱᢐᢛᢓᢏᢠᡭᡳᠡᢐᠭᠪᠾᠱᠩᠠᢏᠦ᠑ᢟᢑᡜᠵ᠀᠒ᢒᡮ</div>"},{"id":"marker132","name":"Elondrethta Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠭\ud802𐠳\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠯\ud802𐠊\udc3f\udc0c 𐠧𐠁\ud802𐠌\udc2f\udc02\udc22\ud802 \udc34𐠱\ud802𐠙\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠲\ud802\ud802 \udc25\udc32\udc24\udc1a\udc03\udc15\ud802\ud802\ud802 \udc38𐠝𐠏\udc1c 𐠎\udc34\udc1d\udc34\udc14\ud802𐠛𐠵\udc25\udc29𐠈</div>"},{"id":"marker133","name":"Kalbrul Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳞⳈⳆⳈ⳥ⲶⳔ⳹ⲼⳒ ⳠⳖⳈⳄⳬⳔⳈⳜⳈⳖ⳹ ⲴⳀⳐⳆⲶⳘⳤⳃ ⳊⳌⳤⳈⳞⳃⳄⲲⳔⳈⳫⳞⳞⳫⳭⳒⳤ ⲸⳄⳬⲺⳜⳂⳃⳈⳲ ⳂⳌⳆ⳩ⳊⲶ⳾ⳢⳊⳔⲺ⳥Ⳑ Ⲻ⳧ⲺⳞ⳹ⳤⳘⳒⳲⲶⳢⳫⳖ ⳆⳀⳁⲲⳎ⳪Ⳮ</div>"},{"id":"marker134","name":"Lirerius Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༮༈༌༨༁༶༥༊༉༚༹༱༭༅༔༣༱༧༲༸༶༷༨༁་༕༆༯༳༛༠༦༥༻༮༃་༻༑༛༶༐༈༐༲༯༨༑༸༊༭༣༉༑༰༠༰༌༅༅༬༲༹༆༬༴༅༯༗༄༒༱༺་ༀ༑༐༵༢༫༯ༀ༑༛</div>"},{"id":"marker135","name":"Ashlas Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳭⳀⳖⳖⳲⳃⳒⲶ ⲾⳌⳜⳢ⳧ⳂⳢⲶⳊⳬⳊⳬⳊ⳾ ⳩Ⲻ⳥ⳲⳠⳊⳤⳔⲾⳠⳁⳂⲾⳖⳬⳈ⳩ⳖⳌⳠⳭⳘⳀⳎ⳪Ⳇ</div>"},{"id":"marker136","name":"Grantford Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༖༈༽༄༄༾༦༓༽༣༛༬༵༽༜༨༲༯༵༁༼༠༖༆༌༅༅༒༧༚༿༤༇༜༶༩༄༉༠༚༌༦༆༌༗༉༥༳༉༬་༺༨༫༗༪༦༓༊༵༇༑༓༒༾༨༵༙༯༼༂༓༰༐༴༲༠</div>"},{"id":"marker137","name":"Bellows Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">አደፈየ ዘሀጠለከሐሠየዘሐፈሐቀፀሐደጰበተተአሐ ከከአሠሀዘነሠሰመሀተፀሠየጸሐዐኀሀቀአ ሐኀነመ</div>"},{"id":"marker138","name":"Nylmlie'a Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ነ  ሰፈ ጠ የ ኀጸፐፈለደ ጠየጸየደረጰጠ ነሰጸሐተ ለፐዐ በወተዐዐሰወየረመየፀፐጸዘወመቀኀየፈፐበሰቀጠጰሐ ፈቀየ ለለመለሠገሀጰደኀቀቀየነጸ</div>"},{"id":"marker139","name":"Regan Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠮᡴᢂᡜᢥ᠐ᡔᡯᠰᢢᡰᢂᡒᠪᡟᡏᡕᡰᡎᠱᡡᢒᡟᢜᡏᡡᢓᡭᡞᢂᡰᡎᡳᢤᢏᡁᡐᢢᢂᠡᢂᡓᢋᡁᡔᠰᡮᠮ</div>"},{"id":"marker140","name":"Barester Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠃\udc28𐠌\udc1a\ud802\ud802𐠑\udc2e\ud802𐠼\ud802\ud802𐠗\udc30𐠓\udc08\udc34\udc37\udc10\udc34\udc22\udc16\ud802𐠛\udc27\udc28\udc26𐠔𐠗\udc15\udc34\udc29\ud802\ud802𐠪\ud802𐠠\udc2a𐠨\udc1b\udc2e \udc28 \ud802\ud802 \udc21\udc22\udc0f𐠒\ud802\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker141","name":"Tlindhil Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">⳩ⲸⲴ⳥ⲸⳈⳃⳊⳲⲲ⳩ⲴⳢⳚⳐⳔⳃ ⳩ⳜⳁⳎⲸⳆ⳪ⳂⳊⳜⳎⳜⳬⳄⲶⳫⳒ⳩⳧Ⳙ ⳎⳫ⳹ⳌⳄ⳩ⲶⳜⳐⲺⳎ Ⳇ⳥Ⳋ⳪ⳁ⳾ⳈⳃⳎⳌⳚⲼ⳾ⲺⳫⳢⳢⳞ</div>"},{"id":"marker142","name":"Ryarion Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༇༔༔༖༹༴༃༶༥༖༴༹༷༲༆༆༷༡༌༔༳༢༿༗ༀ༗༌༰༡༦༛༇༓༬༺༐༛༖༘༇༥༆༽༤༖༈༥༪༑༊༔༪༾༱༑༮༓༠༄༨༉༬༪༥༻༙༮༼༜༅༌༰༿༗༹༥ༀ༥༧༨༬༑༁༇༴༓་</div>"},{"id":"marker143","name":"Louthescast Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">⳪Ⳙ⳧ⳠⳈ ⳢⳒⲺⲾ⳩ⳞⳔⳀⳆ⳥Ⲷ⳩Ⲷ Ⲿ⳾ⳚⳬⳆ ⳥Ⳗ Ⲽ⳧ⲶⲴⳄⲶ ⳫⳤⳔ Ⲳ⳩ⳲⲼⳲⳢ ⳘⳫⳢⲸ ⳁ⳧⳥⳧ Ⳇ ⳪ⲼⳜ ⳪ⳘⳠⲼⳊⳠⳈⳔⳫⳜⳄ⳥Ⳋ⳪⳧Ⳇ⳾ⳠⳊⳚⳆⲾⳌⳢⳢⳌ⳾ⳲⳖ</div>"},{"id":"marker144","name":"Azzol Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠁\ud802\ud802 \udc0e\udc3c\udc1e\udc1b\udc28 \udc02\ud802\ud802 \udc1e\ud802 \udc28\ud802\ud802𐠖𐠜\ud802𐠬𐠵\udc29\udc20\ud802𐠳𐠊\udc12\ud802𐠐 \udc23\ud802 \udc32\udc3f\ud802𐠏𐠪\ud802𐠛\udc20</div>"},{"id":"marker145","name":"Helsbury Idol","legend":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳚⳐⳤⳊⳜⲸⳊ⳧ⳤⳬ ⳭⲸⳒⳫⳄⳚⳘⳐⳞ ⲼⳌⳬⲾ⳾ⳐⲴⳔⲾⳎⲲⲶⳄⳘ⳪ⲲⳘⳔⲴⲼⳃⳞⳈⲺⳢⳭⳆ</div>"},{"id":"marker146","name":"Eshthelolya Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ፈ የኀረፀለበአከተከዐከጰረለዘበሠ ጠየወፀሐገዘበሠመሐሀቀፀቀዘ በፈጰፈበሰሰ ዐሰመተበሀዐአረየአሰከየዘረበበበሠመተዐፈጰነበገከ ሠፐጠገሰወጠዐበተመፀመ ሀየረመሠ</div>"},{"id":"marker147","name":"Narirallena Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠤\udc35\udc20\udc34\udc33\ud802𐠫𐠮\udc0c\udc15\ud802\ud802 𐠕\udc31\udc2f\udc33\ud802\ud802𐠚𐠳\udc04\udc28\udc0a \udc0b\ud802 \ud802\ud802𐠩𐠼\udc12\udc17𐠚\udc2a\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker148","name":"Bearcoast Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡴᡜᡠᡕᡳᡟᢠᡗᢟᡆᠵᢑᢒᢜᠮᢜᡴᡴ᠀ᠱᡐ᠐ᢒᢓᡍ᠑ᢜᢟᠮᡆᢐᢤᡗᡠᢡᡠᡡᠪᠾᢠᡯᡱᢡᡴ᠀ᡑᡠᡮᠠᡁᠩᡗᡟᡠᢢᢞᢤᢜᠪᡗᢑᢛᢜᡰᢞᡠᢋᠳᠽᡙᡐᠨᠵᡒᠰᢟᡱᢟᠽᡰᠳ</div>"},{"id":"marker149","name":"Tlaunan Idol","legend":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc04𐠩𐠚\udc32\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠢\udc16\udc18\udc30\udc31\udc27\udc14  \udc10\udc03 𐠑\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802 \udc2e\ud802𐠭\ud802\ud802𐠝\udc17\udc22\ud802\ud802 \udc1f𐠈𐠷\udc38\ud802𐠈\udc2a\udc03\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠒\ud802𐠣\udc37\udc21\ud802\ud802\ud802 𐠔𐠥 \udc02\ud802𐠨\udc38</div>"},{"id":"marker150","name":"Deercross Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc30\udc04\udc19\udc29\ud802𐠋\udc1b\udc38\udc10\ud802𐠁\ud802𐠟\udc04\ud802\ud802𐠷\udc05𐠅\ud802𐠼\udc2f\udc2d\ud802\ud802𐠕\udc15𐠥 \udc33\ud802\ud802𐠸𐠐\ud802𐠭𐠷𐠮\udc0b\ud802 \udc38\udc03\udc24\udc0a\ud802\ud802 \ud802𐠔𐠷\udc17𐠞𐠡\udc2b\udc20\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠁\ud802𐠅\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠕𐠰\udc11\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠷\udc02\udc28</div>"},{"id":"marker151","name":"Mythsthas Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳈⳠⳌⲺⲲⳐⳂⳢⳂ Ⲹ ⳤⳞⳒⳤⳢⳭ⳾Ⲹ⳾Ⳏ ⳚⲲⳀⳁⳌⳚ ⳘⳘⳢⲸⳔⳄⳀⳭⳞⳈⲼⲺⳁⳫⳬⳔ ⳄⳚⳫⲸⳎⳲ⳪ⳆⳀⳚⲸⳞⲴⲼⳬⳊⳆⳐⳫⳘⲲⳒⲴ⳩Ⳃ⳹ⲼⳆⳬ ⳹ ⲺⳃⳖⳚⳆⲸⲴⳤ</div>"},{"id":"marker152","name":"Amnes Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠯᡖᡝᠭᡙᢟᠡᠱᢤᠨ᠀ᡎᡁᠯᡙᠡᢢᡕ᠐ᢡᢁ᠑ᢥᢂᡕᡎᠪᡗᡲᡖᢋᢢᢂᠡᢥᡜ᠐ᠿᠧᡕᡖᢓ᠒ᡖ</div>"},{"id":"marker153","name":"Holdon Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༆༥༾༗་༷༂༄༂༤༰༘༈༭༭༾༫༳༵༼༣༲༅༗་༩༽༯༽༄༰༥༧༧༺༨༡༌༗༫༻༢༢༮༕༛༌༲༁༯༙༳༬༕༡༰༷༚༡ༀ༧༜༿༖༉༭༥༩༩༸༤༄</div>"},{"id":"marker154","name":"Ryvenorlor Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ፈዐጠደተሰተፈነከፈበቀረከነዐጰደየዐከመደወወሰፀለረረሀየቀአገዐሐሀኀዘሀበጸሰለአመመበፀአዘጸተዘለ ከ</div>"},{"id":"marker155","name":"Neanolyalon Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">᠒ᠠᢂᡳ᠑ᢂᠽᠵᠧᠵᢑᡍᡖᠱᠽᠨᠰᡟᡯᡔᡞᡗᢦᡓᢒᠽᠯᠧᠧᢟᠵᡁ᠑ᠼᡑᠵᠧᢢᡠᡕᠽᡝᡡᢢᡝᠭᠪᡱᡖᠠ᠀ᡗᡱᢠᢜᠧᢀᢞᡜ᠒ᡀᡎᢤᢦᡏᡀ᠀ᠲᠧᡒᢋᡑᡒᢂᠼᢋᡙᡔᠱᡡᠰᡏᡐᡠᠧᠻᡝᠩᢀᠱ</div>"},{"id":"marker156","name":"Eshthalas Idol","legend":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳌⳄⳢⲲⳂⳔⳎⳭⳈⳔⳈⳜ⳹ⲲⳊⳚⳂⳘⳲ⳥⳪ⲶⳜⳌ⳧Ⲷ⳪ⳢⳜ ⳩ⳊⳌ⳹ⲶⳖⳈ⳩ⳃⳈⳲ⳪ⲺⲾⳠⲲⳠ⳪⳾Ⳉ⳾ⳄⳁⳀⳖⲾⳫⳒ⳪ ⳾⳾Ⳓ ⳊⲺⳠⲾⳃ⳧ⳬⳤⳫⳐⲶⲾⳈⳖⲺⳭⲾ ⳄⲼⳊⳆ⳪⳧ⳢⲴ</div>"},{"id":"marker157","name":"Caltashwel Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠅𐠎𐠧\ud802\ud802𐠱\udc3c𐠎\udc1a\udc3c𐠮\udc26\udc04\udc1e\udc2b\ud802\ud802  \ud802𐠬\udc11𐠞\udc17\udc29𐠏\udc14\udc28\ud802 𐠟\ud802𐠙𐠿𐠐\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠕𐠿𐠍\ud802\ud802𐠔\ud802\ud802𐠩\udc12𐠅\ud802𐠬\udc31\udc3f\udc35\udc38\udc1c \udc2a\udc16𐠅 \ud802𐠋</div>"},{"id":"marker158","name":"Linzan Idol","legend":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠠\udc03\udc14\ud802\ud802𐠩\ud802\ud802𐠣\udc2f\udc0f\udc20𐠣\udc22𐠷\udc26\ud802𐠨𐠘 \udc19\udc0d \udc21\udc13\ud802𐠨\udc15\udc1d\udc27\ud802\ud802𐠚\udc26𐠰𐠅\udc35𐠂\udc38𐠔\udc05\ud802\ud802𐠦\ud802𐠙</div>"},{"id":"marker159","name":"Ilentdagon Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠨᡀᡒᠩᢓᠵᢏᡖᢠᡒᡖᢡᢁᢢᢞᡆ᠑ᡕᢑᡀᠦᡜᡱᡔᡑᡓᡕᢏᠱᡆᡮᡠ᠀ᢂᡖᡙᡭᡐᡖᡀᠮᡳᡙᡀᢒ᠐ᢟᡟᡍᢥᠱᡓᡏᠧᢞᡁᡓ᠀ᡮᡆ</div>"},{"id":"marker160","name":"Ghegrudh Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༃༠༠༰༔༸༈༄༌༱༙༡༡༻༘༈༵༬༠༇༈༵༫༨༒༌